From: Kovid Goyal <kovid@kovidgoyal.net>
Subject: [PATCH] Backport PoDoFo 1.1.2 support to calibre 8.9.0

Adapt to the PoDoFo 1.1 API, including stream truncation, resources,
destinations and string views. Preserve uncompressed output and use PoDoFo's
garbage collector for unused fonts and duplicate images. Include the
upstream regression tests.

Backported from:
https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre/commit/dce04dbaddb3f4d4606c1299976d1268ab7275a3
https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre/commit/213fa4a4fe8e2918c1c624c3db154f657727f070

Omit upstream's bundled dependency and macOS packaging changes.

